{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914870/extras/32398b971271659a0a53b411fada66f9.avif?t=1762355669\" width=1280 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERQUIZ</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced, high-quality, game-show-style trivia experience</strong> that pits you against players across the globe! Jump into an online match to compete against the world, or challenge your friends (or play solo) in a private match to compete for bragging rights. HYPERQUIZ is<strong> good trivia</strong>, not user-submitted or AI slop - it's designed to be the definitive online free-answer trivia game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914870/extras/4d3f12c567f85ea8efb66276736754af.poster.avif?t=1762355669\" width=436 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914870/extras/4d3f12c567f85ea8efb66276736754af.webm?t=1762355669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914870/extras/4d3f12c567f85ea8efb66276736754af.mp4?t=1762355669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into\u00a0<strong>online matchmaking</strong> and instantly compete against players from around the world. The pressure is on! The faster you answer correctly, the quicker you fill your HYPERGAUGE. Once your HYPERGAUGE is primed, be the first to correctly answer a question to<strong> win the match</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914870/extras/998c7c17d6ad15659cac0b7ee7622472.avif?t=1762355669\" width=1280 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPERQUIZ questions are <strong>not computer-generated or user-submitted.\u00a0</strong>They are meticulously hand-written by industry professionals to test your expertise across a vast range of topics. At launch, our database has over<strong> 20,000 expertly written questions</strong> covering 16 diverse categories, with new content being added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't worry about small typos.</strong> Every question has a <strong>curated bank of acceptable answers</strong> that allows for variations, common abbreviations, and reasonable misspellings. Our system is designed to reward knowledge, not perfect typing. <strong>Prove you know the answer, and you'll fill your HYPERGAUGE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914870?t=1762355669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914870?t=1762355669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914870/c837f70c13b5aec2e602b330c1c6144085a84da9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762355669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914870/c837f70c13b5aec2e602b330c1c6144085a84da9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762355669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a